<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Hargrove &amp; Pierce · Attorneys</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--navy:#0E2038;--navy-2:#16304F;--gold:#C6A15B;--gold-d:#A9863F;--paper:#F5F3EE;--ink:#1D2733;--muted:#5E6875;}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff}
.bar{background:var(--navy);color:#C9D2DE;font-size:13px;padding:9px 60px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;letter-spacing:.3px}
.bar b{color:var(--gold)}
.head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 60px;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E3DA}
.logo{font-family:'Playfair Display';font-weight:600;font-size:26px;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:.5px}
.logo span{display:block;font-family:'Source Sans 3';font-size:11px;letter-spacing:4px;color:var(--gold-d);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:2px}
.nav{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:15px;color:#33404F}
.consult{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.5px}
.hero{color:#fff;padding:96px 60px 104px;position:relative;
 background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(14,32,56,.96) 0%,rgba(14,32,56,.86) 45%,rgba(14,32,56,.55) 100%),
 url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505664194779-8beaceb93744?w=1700&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(600px 300px at 85% 20%,rgba(198,161,91,.16),transparent 70%)}
.hero .in{position:relative;max-width:720px}
.hero .e{color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:20px}
.hero h1{font-family:'Playfair Display';font-weight:600;font-size:60px;line-height:1.08}
.rule{width:70px;height:3px;background:var(--gold);margin:26px 0}
.hero p{color:#C6CEDA;font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;max-width:600px}
.cta{margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:16px}
.btn-g{background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;padding:16px 32px;border:none;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.5px}
.btn-o{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1px solid #3C5471;padding:15px 28px;font-size:16px}
.prac{padding:80px 60px;background:var(--paper)}
.prac .e{text-align:center;color:var(--gold-d);letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:10px}
.prac h2{text-align:center;font-family:'Playfair Display';font-size:40px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:46px}
.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DFD4}
.col{padding:34px 26px;border-right:1px solid #E9E4D8}
.col:last-child{border-right:none}
.col h3{font-family:'Playfair Display';font-size:22px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px}
.col p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.65}
.col .no{font-family:'Playfair Display';color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:14px}
.trust{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:56px 60px;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;text-align:center}
.trust span{font-family:'Playfair Display';font-size:46px;color:var(--gold);display:block}
.trust p{color:#AEB8C6;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px}
.foot{padding:34px 60px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #E7E3DA}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .bar{flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:8px 22px;text-align:center}
 .head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:16px 22px}
 .nav{display:none}
 .hero{padding:52px 22px 60px}
 .hero h1{font-size:36px}
 .hero p{font-size:16px}
 .cta{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
 .prac{padding:48px 22px}
 .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .col{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid #E9E4D8}
 .col:last-child{border-bottom:none}
 .trust{flex-direction:column;gap:22px;padding:40px 22px}
 .foot{flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:24px 22px}
}
</style></head>
<body>
<div class="bar"><span>Serving Florida since 1994</span><span><b>Free consultation:</b> (813) 555-0170</span></div>
<header class="head">
  <div class="logo">Hargrove &amp; Pierce<span>Attorneys at Law</span></div>
  <nav class="nav"><span>Practice Areas</span><span>Attorneys</span><span>Results</span><span>Insights</span></nav>
  <a class="consult">Free Consultation</a>
</header>
<section class="hero"><div class="in">
  <div class="e">Personal Injury · Estate · Business Law</div>
  <h1>When it matters most, experience matters.</h1>
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <p>Four decades representing Florida families and businesses — with the candor of a small firm and the resources of a large one.</p>
  <div class="cta"><button class="btn-g">Request a Free Consultation</button><button class="btn-o">Our Case Results</button></div>
</div></section>
<section class="prac">
  <div class="e">How we help</div>
  <h2>Practice Areas</h2>
  <div class="cols">
    <div class="col"><div class="no">01</div><h3>Personal Injury</h3><p>Auto, premises, and wrongful death claims pursued on contingency.</p></div>
    <div class="col"><div class="no">02</div><h3>Estate Planning</h3><p>Wills, trusts, and probate handled with discretion and care.</p></div>
    <div class="col"><div class="no">03</div><h3>Business Law</h3><p>Formation, contracts, and disputes for local companies.</p></div>
    <div class="col"><div class="no">04</div><h3>Real Estate</h3><p>Transactions, title, and litigation across the Gulf Coast.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="trust">
  <div><span>$85M+</span><p>Recovered for clients</p></div>
  <div><span>30+</span><p>Years of practice</p></div>
  <div><span>No fee</span><p>Unless we win</p></div>
</section>
<footer class="foot"><span>© 2026 Hargrove &amp; Pierce, P.A. · Tampa, FL</span><span>Attorney advertising. Prior results do not guarantee outcomes.</span></footer>
</body></html>
